# THE POUR'S LIGHT IS WHAT SHOWS YOU (21_doors `room_dark`, `_screens`): the same
# body, standing up and not hiding, for longer than a turret takes to sweep its
# round (StealthQuery.SWEEP_PERIOD): behind the cooling racks nothing in the
# foundry has it; in front of them, in the pour's light, a turret fires.
#
#   tools/tour.sh tours/foundry-light.tour --seed=4 --hour=15 --weather=clear:0
#
# 01 is behind the racks after a full sweep and more: unnoticed, and no turret
# has fired the whole time (`unshot`). 02 is in front of them after the same: a
# turret has fired on the player.
coast calm
near door:foundry
await door 5
press use 0.1
await inside:foundry 5
near behind:cast_rack
wait 12.0
shot 01-behind-the-racks-a-whole-sweep-unseen with inside:foundry,unnoticed,unshot
near thing:cast_rack
wait 12.0
shot 02-in-the-pours-light-a-turret-fires with inside:foundry,turret_shot
